{%- comment -%}
  Beg Borrow Steal Studio - Interactive FAQ Section (Rendered above footer)
{%- endcomment -%}

<style>
  .bbs-faq-section {
    background-color: #faf8f5;
    padding-top: 65px;
    padding-bottom: 75px;
    font-family: var(--font-body-family, inherit);
    border-top: 1px solid #ede7df;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .bbs-faq-container {
    max-width: 920px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-left: 20px;
    padding-right: 20px;
  }

  .bbs-faq-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 42px;
  }

  .bbs-faq-subtitle {
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #8c6239;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .bbs-faq-title {
    font-size: clamp(22px, 3.5vw, 34px);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #5a3a0a;
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .bbs-faq-desc {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #6b4d24;
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .bbs-faq-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .bbs-faq-item {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #ede7df;
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: border-color 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
  }

  .bbs-faq-item:hover {
    border-color: #d4c5b3;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(90, 58, 10, 0.04);
  }

  .bbs-faq-summary {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 18px 22px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #5a3a0a;
    user-select: none;
    list-style: none;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .bbs-faq-summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .bbs-faq-summary:hover {
    color: #3b2403;
  }

  .bbs-faq-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: #f7f3ee;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-left: 16px;
    transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1), background-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .bbs-faq-icon svg {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    stroke: #5a3a0a;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  details[open] .bbs-faq-summary {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #f2ece4;
  }

  details[open] .bbs-faq-icon {
    background-color: #5a3a0a;
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  details[open] .bbs-faq-icon svg {
    stroke: #ffffff;
  }

  .bbs-faq-content {
    padding: 18px 22px 22px 22px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #5a3a0a;
    animation: bbsFaqFadeIn 0.3s ease-out;
  }

  .bbs-faq-content p {
    margin: 0 0 10px 0;
  }
  .bbs-faq-content p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .bbs-faq-content a {
    color: #5a3a0a;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .bbs-faq-footer-note {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 35px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #7a582c;
  }

  .bbs-faq-footer-note a {
    color: #5a3a0a;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  @keyframes bbsFaqFadeIn {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    .bbs-faq-section {
      padding-top: 45px;
      padding-bottom: 55px;
    }
    .bbs-faq-summary {
      padding: 15px 16px;
      font-size: 15px;
    }
    .bbs-faq-content {
      padding: 15px 16px 18px 16px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  }
</style>

<div class="bbs-faq-section" id="bbs-store-faq">
  <div class="bbs-faq-container">
    <div class="bbs-faq-header">
      <div class="bbs-faq-subtitle">NEED HELP?</div>
      <h2 class="bbs-faq-title">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</h2>
      <p class="bbs-faq-desc">Everything you need to know about our curation, authenticity, condition, and private appointments.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bbs-faq-list">
      <details class="bbs-faq-item" open>
        <summary class="bbs-faq-summary">
          <span>Are your designer pieces authentic?</span>
          <span class="bbs-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M6 1v10M1 6h10" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="bbs-faq-content">
          <p>Yes. Every designer piece is carefully inspected and authenticated before being offered for sale. We work with trusted authentication services including Legit Grails, Real Authentication, Luxury Authentication Australia, The Legit App, and other industry-recognised experts to ensure every item is authentic and accurately represented.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="bbs-faq-item">
        <summary class="bbs-faq-summary">
          <span>Do your items come with an authentication certificate?</span>
          <span class="bbs-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M6 1v10M1 6h10" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="bbs-faq-content">
          <p>Authentication certificates for designer pieces can be arranged upon request through our trusted third-party authentication partners, where applicable. For paintings and artworks, the artist's certificate of authenticity will accompany the piece wherever available and as specified in the product description.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="bbs-faq-item">
        <summary class="bbs-faq-summary">
          <span>Are your pieces pre-loved?</span>
          <span class="bbs-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M6 1v10M1 6h10" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="bbs-faq-content">
          <p>No. Beg Borrow Steal Studio is not a pre-loved reseller. We specialise in carefully curated vintage, antiques and exceptional deadstock pieces sourced through trusted auctions, specialist vendors and long-standing collectors around the world.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="bbs-faq-item">
        <summary class="bbs-faq-summary">
          <span>What does &ldquo;deadstock&rdquo; mean?</span>
          <span class="bbs-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M6 1v10M1 6h10" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="bbs-faq-content">
          <p>Deadstock refers to authentic vintage items that have never been sold to or used by a consumer. Although many pieces are decades old, they have remained unworn and carefully preserved by manufacturers, authorised vendors, collectors, or specialist dealers.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="bbs-faq-item">
        <summary class="bbs-faq-summary">
          <span>What condition are your vintage and antique pieces in?</span>
          <span class="bbs-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M6 1v10M1 6h10" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="bbs-faq-content">
          <p>Every piece is individually assessed and accurately described before being offered for sale. While many of our deadstock pieces remain in exceptional condition, vintage and antique items may display light signs of age or natural patina, which form part of their history and character. Any notable wear or restoration is always clearly disclosed.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="bbs-faq-item">
        <summary class="bbs-faq-summary">
          <span>Can I request additional photographs, videos or measurements before purchasing?</span>
          <span class="bbs-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M6 1v10M1 6h10" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="bbs-faq-content">
          <p>Absolutely. We're happy to provide additional photographs, videos, or measurements to help you make an informed purchase. Simply contact us via WhatsApp at <a href="https://wa.me/919136047270" target="_blank" rel="noopener">+91 91360 47270</a> or <a href="mailto:begborrowstealstudio@gmail.com">email us</a>, and we'll be happy to assist.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="bbs-faq-item">
        <summary class="bbs-faq-summary">
          <span>Can I view items in person?</span>
          <span class="bbs-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M6 1v10M1 6h10" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="bbs-faq-content">
          <p>Yes. Private viewings are available by appointment at our studio located at <strong>Flat No 1, New Shams Building CHS, 76 Turner Road, Bandra West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400050</strong>. Please <a href="mailto:begborrowstealstudio@gmail.com">contact us</a> to arrange a suitable time.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>

    <div class="bbs-faq-footer-note">
      Have more questions? <a href="mailto:begborrowstealstudio@gmail.com">Get in touch with us</a> or WhatsApp us at <a href="https://wa.me/919136047270" target="_blank" rel="noopener">+91 91360 47270</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
